{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>WolfGirl RoomMate</strong>, an engaging and daring clicker game where your mission is to build a special bond with your captivating wolf girl roommate! Accumulate &quot;lust&quot; points to unlock intriguing scenes, passionate dialogues, and ever-spicier moments that deepen your connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click brings you closer to unlocking new content, but you're never alone on this journey! You'll also get to collect a variety of cute little creatures as automatic upgrades, each with unique abilities and different stats, helping you generate &quot;lust&quot; points even when you're not actively playing. These adorable companions not only add a strategic layer to the gameplay but also bring a touch of sweetness to your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive gallery:</strong> Collect and revisit every special scene with your wolf girl, viewable at any time in the unlocked image gallery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138460/extras/5bb03727db1160879f0d44525efa0beb.avif?t=1770719726\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138460/extras_big/5bb03727db1160879f0d44525efa0beb.avif?t=1770719726 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal-themed upgrades:</strong> Utilize a range of charming little creatures, each with unique stats, to boost your &quot;lust&quot; points automatically and accelerate your progress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138460/extras/a17c1037adface08e995315b739f0058.avif?t=1770719726\" width=90 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas